# TclGuard release-signing PUBLIC key (ECDSA P-256), used to verify signed updates.
#
# *** UNSET: this build has no signing key. While the line below says UNSET, 'tclguard update apply'
# *** refuses to install anything and 'update check' reports results as unverified.
#
# The maintainer generates the key pair once with:   tclguard update keygen --out release-signing.key
# keeps the private file OFFLINE (and in the CI secret RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY), and pastes the printed
# "tgpub1:..." line here in place of the UNSET line, then commits and rebuilds the starpack.
# See docs/UPDATES.md.
tgpub1:UNSET
